/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (Here is an actual saved example, not an invented demonstration. The question asks which league Sporting\012Canamy was in. The supplied target is Tercera Divisi\363n de M\351xico. The cap-free model emits a newline\012immediately, so its bounded answer is empty. All three displayed cap conditions acquire the taught answer.\012\012Now move to the end of the thousand-edit stream. The learned and random-reader conditions still answer\012the original question correctly, but the stable cap's bounded answer is empty. Rephrase the question,\012and the learned reader still supplies the target. The random reader supplies the name of a different\012club, while the stable cap says forward. That is a concrete difference between storing a correction and\012retrieving the right correction when the wording changes.\012\012This is the first item of one realization and one order, selected to make the mechanisms understandable.\012It is an old memory by the endpoint, and it is not a representative sample of the entire experiment.\012The aggregate results come later. I have removed leading display spaces from these quotations; the\012source file retains the complete generated strings and scoring flags.) /Name Comment /QuadPoints [ 1218 675 1235 675 1218 692 1235 692 ] /Rect [ 1218 675 1235 692 ] /Subtype /Text 
  /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
