/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (This optional example shows Marion Brown taught the counterfactual target West Coast hip hop, with jazz\012as the stored old answer. The learned cap supplies the target on the original prompt and its paraphrase\012at three hundred edits. A second example about Bettino Ricasoli keeps Methodism on the original prompt\012but produces an empty answer on the paraphrase, even though the stored selection flag says the cap fired.\012That differs from the CounterFact no-fire example. We cannot conclude that every paraphrase failure\012has the same cause. We also cannot claim multi-hop reasoning: this test uses the single-hop edit and\012paraphrase portion of the task. These selected examples do not estimate a success rate.) /Name Comment /QuadPoints [ 1218 675 1235 675 1218 692 1235 692 ] /Rect [ 1218 675 1235 692 ] /Subtype /Text 
  /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
