/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (Delta loss compares the observed next token at a common prefix. KL compares the whole predictive\012distribution, in the reference-to-cap direction. Signed mean loss retains improvements as negative\012values. Conditional severity uses only values above the specified threshold. Expected shortfall uses\012the positive part over the full inventory, including zero values. We sort that inventory and take the\012fractional mean of its worst one percent. Because one percent of 245,237 is not an integer, the boundary\012observation gets fractional weight. A maximum is a different statistic again. Inferences over windows\012condition on the tested models and subject populations; they do not cover training or subject variation.) /Name Comment /QuadPoints [ 1218 675 1235 675 1218 692 1235 692 ] /Rect [ 1218 675 1235 692 ] /Subtype /Text 
  /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
