/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (The random-direction control retains the norm and pays for the true error-credit calculation before\012replacing the direction. Its only attempted random stream stopped at 993 edits under the resource rule,\012with three immediate successes. Ten planned cells were unstarted. It supports the practical importance\012of informative direction on that stream, not a universal impossibility result about random search.\012\012For the compute control, charlie approved funding additional acquisition updates rather than repeated\012derivative calculations at unchanged writes. The adjoint condition was offered the measured per-item\012PC operation allowance. It used only about fifty-three to fifty-eight percent, because its stopping\012rules usually ended acquisition sooner. This does not isolate extra computation as a cause of the PC\012effect, nor is it a FLOP-matched experiment. The six complete pairs and the partial random experiment\012are reported separately.) /Name Comment /QuadPoints [ 1218 675 1235 675 1218 692 1235 692 ] /Rect [ 1218 675 1235 692 ] /Subtype /Text 
  /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
