/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (The fourth-realization extension completed twenty learned-reader and random-reader cells, at a thousand\012edits, across five orders and two datasets. The new-realization paraphrase means are shown here. Combining\012four realization-level contrasts gives a learned-minus-random mean of about forty-four percentage points\012on zsRE and fifty-six on CounterFact. The supplemental t intervals assume normal realization errors and\012are unadjusted; they are not a replacement familywise analysis. The own-prompt contrasts are negative,\012so the generalization gain still needs to be distinguished from literal prompt retention. One stable-cap\012attempt was incomplete and nine such cells were deferred. Those missing comparisons are not zeroes.) /Name Comment /QuadPoints [ 1218 675 1235 675 1218 692 1235 692 ] /Rect [ 1218 675 1235 692 ] /Subtype /Text 
  /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
