/C [ 0 0 0 ] /Contents (The submitted title is Coupled Active Inference on a Frozen Transformer Prior: A Risk-Aware Residual\012Agent for Non-Equilibrium Regimes, by charlie derr and Matthew Ikl\351. The main report and its triplet\012analysis support the main comparison. The supplemental reports distinguish the acquisition-credit,\012reader-training, mixture and upper-layer experiments. Capstan's support-information collection provides\012the saved input and output examples. Our post-conference proposal identifies the unresolved modeling\012choices for a coupled-objective and audit-policy collaboration. This talk is a snapshot of completed\012results through October fourth; earlier documents that say a result is pending are historical.) /Name Comment /QuadPoints [ 1218 675 1235 675 1218 692 1235 692 ] /Rect [ 1218 675 1235 692 ] /Subtype /Text 
  /Type /Annot
>>
endobj
